<title>USA: Oshkosh B'Gosh Inc Q4 loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Oshkosh B'Gosh Inc Q4 loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>OSHKOSH, Wis. 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.22   profit	 $0.14</p>
<p> Net loss		   2,602   profit	 1,710</p>
