<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 1996 includes $7.2 million, or $0.60 a share after-tax charge for for the writedown of certain property and the closing of the company's Columbia, Kentucky, manufacturing facility.  </p>
